{
  "sn51.32:0.1": "Linked Discourses 51.32 ",
  "sn51.32:0.2": "3. The Iron Ball ",
  "sn51.32:0.3": "The Realized One ",
  "sn51.32:1.1": "There the Buddha addressed the mendicants: ",
  "sn51.32:1.2": "“What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "sn51.32:1.3": "What things has the Realized One developed and cultivated so as to have such power and might?” ",
  "sn51.32:2.1": "“Our teachings are rooted in the Buddha. …” ",
  "sn51.32:2.2": "“The Realized One has become so powerful and mighty by developing and cultivating the four bases of psychic power. ",
  "sn51.32:3.1": "What four? ",
  "sn51.32:3.2": "It’s when a mendicant develops the basis of psychic power that has immersion due to enthusiasm, and active effort. ",
  "sn51.32:3.3": "He thinks: ‘My enthusiasm won’t be too lax or too tense. And it’ll be neither constricted internally nor scattered externally.’ ",
  "sn51.32:3.4": "And he meditates perceiving before and behind: ",
  "sn51.32:3.5": "as before, so behind; as behind, so before; ",
  "sn51.32:3.6": "as below, so above; as above, so below; ",
  "sn51.32:3.7": "as by day, so by night; as by night, so by day. ",
  "sn51.32:3.8": "And so, with an open and unenveloped heart, he develops a mind that’s full of radiance. ",
  "sn51.32:3.9": "He develops the basis of psychic power that has immersion due to energy … ",
  "sn51.32:3.10": "mental development … ",
  "sn51.32:3.11": "inquiry, and active effort. ",
  "sn51.32:3.12": "He thinks: ‘My inquiry won’t be too lax or too tens